"Tier 2":"Tier 2",
"CDN / content":"CDN / contenu",
"Eyeballs":"Eyeballs",
"Enterprise DIA":"DIA entreprise",
"Game servers":"Serveurs de jeu",
"Hosting":"Hébergement",
"Downstream ISP (buys transit)":"FAI downstream (achète du transit)",
"L2VPN circuit":"Circuit L2VPN",
"Streaming startup":"Startup de streaming",
"University network":"Réseau universitaire",
"AI GPU data center":"Datacenter GPU pour l’IA",
