"{optic} to spares":"{optic} en rechange",
"<b>Sold a spare {optic} on eBuy.</b><br>{price} back, which is {p} of what it cost new.":"<b>{optic} de rechange vendue sur eBuy.</b><br>{price} récupérés, soit {p} de son prix neuf.",
